# text = Hicks , Champagne to Miss Swartz Let George cut in directly and win her Strike while the iron's hot , you know -- while she's fresh to the town : in a few weeks some d --- fellow from the West End will come in with a title and a rotten rent-roll and cut all us City men out , as Lord Fitzrufus did last year with Miss Grogram , who was actually engaged to Podder , of Podder & amp ; Brown's .
