# text = Missis can't abide 'em Missis needn't smoke Dear sir Miss Crawley has passed an exceedingly disturbed night , owing to the shocking manner in which the house has been polluted by tobacco ; Miss Crawley bids me say she regrets that she is too unwell to see you before you go -- and above all that she ever induced you to remove from the ale-house , where she is sure you will be much more comfortable during the rest of your stay at Brighton my pistols , the same which I shot Captain Marker Why Why does not our dear Miss come to her nephew and niece , and her attached friends in Paris ?
